    {
      "number": 32,
      "category": "shijia",
      "title": "齊太公世家第二",
      "paragraph_id": "c-shiji-032-qi:p076",
      "count": 1,
      "raw_count": 1,
      "duplicate_count": 0,
      "counting_policy": "independent_fixed_witness_occurrences",
      "quote": "，赴于吳。吳王夫差哭於軍門外三日，將從海入討齊。齊人敗之，吳師乃去。晉趙鞅伐齊，至賴而去。齊人共立悼公子壬，是為簡公。",
      "paragraph_ids": [
        "c-shiji-032-qi:p076"
